// Advent of Code 2024 · Day 15 · Warehouse Woes
// Part 1: the robot pushes boxes around; sum the GPS coordinates (100 * row + col) of all boxes.
// Part 2: same moves in a double-width warehouse where boxes are "[]" and can push two boxes at once.

let SAMPLE = "##########
#..O..O.O#
#......O.#
